m the late 60s in the game think yeah  okay and yeah I mean obviously you know  Lincoln clay is a Vietnam vet so that's  that's always running through the  background were really grounded in  nineteen you know 68 and we reference  events that happen all around that time  period so obviously it was such a  turbulent year with you know the MLK  assassination Robert Kennedy yeah the  democratic national convention so  there's so much stuff going on that year  that you know we couldn't ignore all  that and it's it provides this really  great backdrop where it feels like  America was this like powder keg and  when you talk to people who lived  through it I mean my dad got back  actually from Vietnam in night in  January of 1968 basically right when  Lincoln comes back so which wasn't  really a coincidence we kind of chose  that because you know in talking to  people who lived through that there was  this sense that like man everything was  just on this razor's edge and one thing  could happen and the whole country could  explode and it was just there's this  underlying tension and so we try and  weave that in throughout the whole game  it thank you so much for joining us when  can we get our hands on Muffy 3 tober 7  tobis evansville Xbox Playstation one  playstation 4 pc awesome thank you so  much thank you um make sure for all the  rest of your a 3 coverage you stay tuned  to gamespot com  you
 

